Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.97,0:14:36.97,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fs38\blur10\bord1\pos(154,638)}世界
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.97,0:14:36.97,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\\pos(154,690)}蔚蓝大海的另一侧有大陆。
